      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EEXCELLENT MARROW-SPINAGE-PASTIES\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake Spinage, and chop it a little; then boil it, till it be tender. In the mean time make the best rich light Crust you can, and roul it out, and put a little of your Spinage into it, and Currants and Sugar, and store of lumps of Marrow; Clap the Past over this to make little Pasties deep within, and fry them with clarified Butter.\u003Cbr\u003E"
